{"id":"nel_zya","lemma":"нельзя","pos":"adj","rank":196,"glosses":["it is impossible (perfective aspect), one cannot, you can't","it is prohibited (imperfective aspect), it is forbidden, it is not allowed, one must not","one cannot"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/00/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%B7%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%B7%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Тебе нельзя здесь есть.","en":"You can't eat here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/218963","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"here"},{"g":"there is / to eat"}]},{"text":"Почему мне нельзя это сделать?","en":"Why can't I do it?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Нельзя всё знать.","en":"It's not possible to know everything.","words":[null,{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…"}]},{"text":"Я знаю, что этого делать нельзя.","en":"I know not to do that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"to make, to do"},null]},{"text":"Почему мне нельзя пойти с тобой?","en":"Why can't I go with you?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"to go"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]}]}